\\<br>fib(1)   fib(0)</pre><pre style=\"font-family: monospace\"></pre></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1</strong>: A single non-negative integer <var>n</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1</strong>: The number of <strong>fib()</strong> calls made to compute the <var>n</var>ᵀᴴ Fibonacci number.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">0 &le; <var>n</var> &le; 50<br>1 &le; number of <strong>fib()</strong> calls made &lt; 50,000,000,000</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">4</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">9</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
